Pipe port arrangement follows the Pyanodons caravan outpost geometry
("outpost-fluid" in Py Alien Life by Pyanodon, GNU GPLv3):
collision_box +/-2.9, selection_box +/-3, single south port at {0.5, 2.5}.
Layout compatibility is intentional: grids piped up for Pyanodons caravans
take these buildings drop-in. No Pyanodons code or assets are included.
